## THE COMMISSION
Three small tickets the project's board already holds, done in series on one branch: (1) test hygiene from the gate of PR #117; (2) a log sanitiser that lets control characters through; (3) the product owner's ruling that the most rows a risk condition returns is 1,000, applied to the one clamp only. The product owner's standing rules apply: merge-once-tested; a gate before every merge; CodeQL is organisational policy and is never bypassed or dismissed; no fix is claimed that a red-first cell has not shown. You measure and build, a gate re-measures, Tuesday opens the PR, reads the runs and CodeQL, and lands.

